  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "Pn̄g伊ê福氣"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>郭伊貞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若是pn̄g伊ê福氣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我就ē-sái kap伊仝款樂暢--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人是一kái就穩tak-tak</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮是革命十kái bē成功ê in老母</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人是sio拍雞仔真厲害</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮是專門hōo人食ê肉雞仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一場試驗suà一場試驗</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人生ê走標場</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tńg-se̍h幾若擺</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像lin-long馬仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kan-na ē-hiáu出gōng力</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">汗水ná流目屎ná滴</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日子kap面底皮king tī hia</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tiānn-tiānn船過水無痕</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一冬過一冬</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">若是pn̄g伊ê福氣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我就ē-sái kap伊仝款出頭天--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人是一tsuā就清氣liu-liu</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮是thut-tshuê ê大目新娘揣無灶</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人是牽繩師傅規家伙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮是浮phànn半桶師仔舊套頭</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一代考驗suà一代考驗</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記憶ê nî-tsînn跤</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">走閃幾若pha</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像透lām一寡有--ê無--ê</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拍ka-la̍uh ê青春賰bē少稀微</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">跤手結lan白頭鬃ná挽顛倒ná濟</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">月娘kap jiâu痕sio照鏡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不時嚨喉空涼涼</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一絲牽一絲</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDSfLG8n31S5kzKHZceYatY9fxnWyX2s83uOUkS1JUVt6RxKQkolw1GMmjBK6IirMZ7nSyyDu8ykehpFjijlumGBIUb9xi7GmwYz3-KKaDCLgyvvQbzh3NQnQWn_4SLbQEvp8uBFV3sSCYjita6r65_iJ1qxTBuzum0eOlrzgeBlCQo1peHr3XXpBCdw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1350%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjDSfLG8n31S5kzKHZceYatY9fxnWyX2s83